<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>自治与他治</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>第 8 篇落点</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>依礼而“自”治</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 1.9, marginTop: 14 }}>依法而“他”治</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 30 }}>第 8 篇。差别落在两个引号字上：一个自己管自己，一个别人来管你。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 4 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>11/19</Text>
  </Box>
